    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Lying crossface extension\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Разгибание лёжа поперёк лица\ncategory: arms\ntier: 1\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=lying%20crossface%20extension\nhelper_id: 124\n---\n\n# Lying crossface extension\n\n**Worst** · [Triceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM)\n\n**Target muscles:** Triceps\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Lie on a bench and lower one dumbbell across the face to the opposite shoulder.\n\n## Key points\n\n- A single-arm Tate press. The arm position is the starting position of the Hawkins-Kennedy impingement test, so there is too much internal rotation.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nNo specific spine concerns: keep the ribs down, a neutral neck and a steady back.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nUse lying triceps extensions instead.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=lying%20crossface%20extension\n"
