    "name": "Overhead extensions (band)",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Overhead extensions (band)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Разгибания над головой с резинкой\ncategory: arms\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=overhead%20triceps%20extension%20band\nequipment_band: true\nspine_warning: true\nhelper_id: 80\n---\n\n# Overhead extensions (band)\n\n**Better still** · [Triceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM)\n\n**Target muscles:** Triceps (long head)\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nStand with your back to the band's anchor point (low or behind you). Hold your hands bent behind your head.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Extend your arms overhead, forward and up.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Deep stretch on the triceps.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Flaring your elbows out to the sides.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\n> [!warning] Spine caution: this exercise can load the lower back or neck more than most. Read the safety note and go light.\n\nPressing overhead with a leaning torso loads the lower back. Split stance, ribs down, glutes tight; no arching to push the hands up.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nAnchor the band low behind you or stand on it. If the back arches, do it seated on a chair.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=overhead%20triceps%20extension%20band\n"
