    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Rocking pushdowns (band)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Разгибания с резинкой с раскачкой (Rocking Pushdowns)\ncategory: arms\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=rocking%20triceps%20pushdown\nequipment_band: true\nspine_warning: true\nhelper_id: 84\n---\n\n# Rocking pushdowns (band)\n\n**Almost best** · [Triceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM)\n\n**Target muscles:** Triceps\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nStand facing the band anchored high, like a cable stack.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. As you extend your arms, lean your torso slightly forward, and on the return, shift your hips back, intensifying the tension at the peak.\n\n## Key points\n\n- A dynamic adjustment of the biomechanics.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Overly chaotic movements.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\n> [!warning] Spine caution: this exercise can load the lower back or neck more than most. Read the safety note and go light.\n\nRocking the hips and torso under load: keep the back neutral and the motion small and slow; do not round or arch the lower back at the end of each rep.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nA band anchored high works. Use a split stance for stability.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=rocking%20triceps%20pushdown\n"
