    "lang": "en",
    "category": "arms",
    "name": "Triceps kickbacks",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Triceps kickbacks\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Разгибания руки в наклоне (Kickbacks)\ncategory: arms\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=triceps%20kickbacks\nhelper_id: 82\n---\n\n# Triceps kickbacks\n\n**Almost best** · [Triceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrAiIvpZvhM)\n\n**Target muscles:** Triceps\n\n## Starting position\n\nHinge over with your torso parallel to the floor. Pin your elbow to your side and keep it raised.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Exhale and extend your arm back until it forms a fully straight line.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Your elbow doesn't drop during the movement.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Swinging the weight instead of extending under control.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nHold the hinge with a long, flat back; do not round or arch it. Rest the free hand on a chair or the sofa to unload the back.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nHand and knee on the sofa, a light dumbbell in the other hand.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=triceps%20kickbacks\n"
