    "name": "Zottman curl",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Zottman curl\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- biceps\n- forearms\naliases:\n- Сгибания Зоттмана\ncategory: arms\ntier: 2\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6g57DJntRXk\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=zottman%20curl\nhelper_id: 121\n---\n\n# Zottman curl\n\n**Better** · [Biceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6g57DJntRXk)\n\n**Target muscles:** Biceps, forearms\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Curl the dumbbells with a supinated grip, rotate to overhand at the top, and lower them slowly.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Biceps do their elbow flexion here, but pronating the hands moves the eccentric load to the brachioradialis, limiting the biceps overload.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nNo specific spine concerns: keep the ribs down, a neutral neck and a steady back.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nDumbbells up to 16 kg.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=zottman%20curl\n"
