    "name": "Incline Y raises",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Incline Y raises\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- traps\n- shoulders\naliases:\n- Y-подъёмы на наклонной\ncategory: back\ntier: 2\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w7OSC-RfKOI\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=incline%20y%20raises\nhelper_id: 136\n---\n\n# Incline Y raises\n\n**Better** · [Trap Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w7OSC-RfKOI)\n\n**Target muscles:** Lower and middle traps\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Lie chest-down on an incline bench and raise the arms overhead into a Y with the thumbs up.\n\n## Key points\n\n- A great corrective exercise that hits the lower and middle traps, but it cannot be loaded as intensely as other trap exercises.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nNo specific spine concerns: keep the ribs down, a neutral neck and a steady back.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nLie chest-down on the sofa with light dumbbells or a band.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=incline%20y%20raises\n"
