    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Bench press (band)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- chest\n- front_delts\n- shoulders\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Жим лёжа с резинкой\ncategory: chest\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=band%20bench%20press\nequipment_band: true\nhelper_id: 77\n---\n\n# Bench press (band)\n\n**Better still** · [Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest, triceps, front delts\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nRun the band across your upper back and hold its ends in your palms, with or without dumbbells. Lie on a bench or on the floor.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Perform a classic press. The band adds resistance in the top portion of the movement.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Lets you keep working the pecs in the fully contracted phase.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Letting the band slide up onto your neck.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nKeep the lower back in a natural curve, feet planted, shoulder blades down; do not arch to chase the band's pull.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nRun the band across the upper back and lie on the sofa or the floor; a floor press protects the shoulders.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=band%20bench%20press\n"
