    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Chest crossover (band)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- chest\naliases:\n- Сведение рук с резинкой (кроссовер)\ncategory: chest\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=band%20chest%20crossover\nequipment_band: true\nhelper_id: 76\n---\n\n# Chest crossover (band)\n\n**Better still** · [Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nThe bands are anchored at shoulder height. Your arms are spread out to the sides and slightly bent.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Bring your arms together in front of your chest in an arc, crossing your hands at the end point to increase the contraction.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Keep the elbow bend angle constant.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Turning the fly into a press.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nHold the ribs down and the torso still; do not lean forward to cross the hands, and keep the elbows slightly bent.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nAnchor two bands at shoulder height on a door, or one band through a door loop.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=band%20chest%20crossover\n"
