    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Guillotine press\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- chest\n- upper_chest\naliases:\n- Гильотинный жим\ncategory: chest\ntier: 1\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=guillotine%20press\nneck_warning: true\nhelper_id: 129\n---\n\n# Guillotine press\n\n**Worst** · [Upper Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest, upper chest\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Press a bar down to the neck instead of the chest.\n\n## Key points\n\n- In the worst group of upper chest exercises: biomechanically improper or just dangerous for the shoulders.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nThe bar travels over the neck and face; with the cervical issues this is a clear no.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nSkip it: use the 30° incline press.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=guillotine%20press\n"
