    "name": "Heavy one-arm crossovers (band)",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Heavy one-arm crossovers (band)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- chest\naliases:\n- Тяжёлый одноручный кроссовер с резинкой\ncategory: chest\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=heavy%20one%20arm%20cable%20crossover\nequipment_band: true\nhelper_id: 92\n---\n\n# Heavy one-arm crossovers (band)\n\n**Almost best** · [Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nStand sideways to the band and grab it with one hand.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Bring your arm across your whole body, as far as possible past the midline of your torso.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Maximum range of contraction for one side of the chest.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Turning your entire torso to follow your arm.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nBrace the torso and do not rotate the lower back; the movement is in the arm and chest, the hips stay square.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nAnchor the band to a door at shoulder height and stand sideways to it.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=heavy%20one%20arm%20cable%20crossover\n"
