    "content": "---\nexercise_name: \"Incline press (band, cable-style)\"\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- upper_chest\n- chest\naliases:\n- Жим на наклонной с резинкой (как на блоке)\ncategory: chest\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=incline%20cable%20press\nequipment_band: true\nhelper_id: 73\n---\n\n# Incline press (band, cable-style)\n\n**Almost best** · [Upper Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest (upper chest)\n\n> [!warning] In the original this exercise uses a cable machine; here it is done with a resistance band.\n\n## Starting position\n\nAnchor the band behind you, low. Take a staggered stance or sit.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Perform pressing movements with your arms forward and slightly upward.\n2. At the end point, bring your hands together for maximum peak contraction.\n\n## Key points\n\n- The resistance increases as your arms straighten.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Losing tension in the band at the bottom.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nBrace the torso so the band does not pull you into an arch; split stance for balance, neck neutral.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nAnchor the band low behind you (door bottom or heavy furniture), or sit on a chair with the band behind the back.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=incline%20cable%20press\n"
