    "name": "UCV raise",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: UCV raise\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- upper_chest\n- chest\naliases:\n- Подъём UCV (UCV Raise)\ncategory: chest\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=UCV%20raise%20upper%20chest\nhelper_id: 70\n---\n\n# UCV raise\n\n**Better still** · [Upper Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest (upper chest)\n\n## Starting position\n\nStand tall with a dumbbell in one hand at your hip, palm facing up.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Exhale and raise your arm from low to high, across your body on a diagonal, to the level of the opposite shoulder.\n2. Squeeze your upper chest. Lower back to the starting position.\n\n## Key points\n\n- The movement is driven by bringing your arm toward the midline.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Doing the work by curling with your biceps.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nRaise the arm along a diagonal without leaning back or twisting the lower back; keep the neck neutral and the weight light.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nOne light dumbbell or a band under the foot.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=UCV%20raise%20upper%20chest\n"
