    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Underhand dumbbell bench press\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- upper_chest\n- chest\naliases:\n- Жим гантелей лёжа обратным хватом\ncategory: chest\ntier: 2\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=underhand%20dumbbell%20bench%20press\nhelper_id: 71\n---\n\n# Underhand dumbbell bench press\n\n**Almost best** · [Upper Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YqFfh5IZUBs)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest (upper chest)\n\n## Starting position\n\nLie on a flat bench and hold the dumbbells with your palms facing you (supinated grip).\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Press the dumbbells up, keeping your elbows closer to your torso.\n2. Lower them until they lightly touch your thighs/chest.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Increases upper chest activation even on a flat bench.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Dumbbells slipping out because of the unfamiliar grip (use a moderate weight).\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\nLower back in its natural curve, feet planted; the supinated grip is harder on the wrists, so go lighter and keep them straight.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nDumbbells on the sofa edge or pressing from the floor; keep the palms facing you.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=underhand%20dumbbell%20bench%20press\n"
