    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Ab wheel rollout\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- abs\n- core\naliases:\n- Ролик для пресса\ncategory: core\ntier: 2\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=ab%20wheel%20rollout\nspine_warning: true\nhelper_id: 145\n---\n\n# Ab wheel rollout\n\n**Better** · [Ab Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks)\n\n**Target muscles:** Abs, core\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Kneel and roll the wheel forward, then pull back with the abs.\n\n## Key points\n\n- A good movement with major limitations that make it less globally successful for everyone.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\n> [!warning] Spine caution: this exercise can load the lower back or neck more than most. Read the safety note and go light.\n\nRolling out far arches the lower back into extension, a clear risk with hyperlordosis. Keep a posterior pelvic tilt and short range.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nNo wheel: use a towel on a smooth floor.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=ab%20wheel%20rollout\n"
