    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Smith machine squat\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- quads\n- glutes\naliases:\n- Присед в Смите\ncategory: legs\ntier: 1\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ud9hEOxJMpQ\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=smith%20machine%20squat\nspine_warning: true\nhelper_id: 147\n---\n\n# Smith machine squat\n\n**Worst** · [Quad Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ud9hEOxJMpQ)\n\n**Target muscles:** Quads, glutes\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Squat with the bar on a fixed vertical or angled rail.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Probably the worst version of a squat: the fixed path does not allow your own biomechanics.\n\n## 🛡️ Spine safety\n\n> [!warning] Spine caution: this exercise can load the lower back or neck more than most. Read the safety note and go light.\n\nHeavy bar on the back with a forced path loads the lumbar spine. Skip.\n\n## 🛋️ At home, with what you have\n\nNo Smith machine at home: use goblet squats.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=smith%20machine%20squat\n"
